Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:35:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: clock: apple,t8010-touch-clock: Add S8000
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The A9 PMGR has the T8010 touch clock block at PMGR offset 0x78000: the
disable bit 31, enable bit 19, busy bit 18 and the divider in bits 9:0,
with an 8 us start and a 100 us stop delay (iOS TCLK functions at
0xfffffff006435fdc, 0xfffffff006435f74 and 0xfffffff00643417c). The
iPad 5 ADT function TCLK(8,100,32768) runs it at 32768 Hz from the
24 MHz reference, a divider of 732.

Describe it with the T8010 compatible as a fallback; the rate comes
from clock-frequency.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
[Orchard: from brkosebay/linux 28c4b7e3 (J71t ledger 8.7); his separate
 clk-apple-s8000-touch driver duplicated Paul Praschl's T8010 touch
 clock driver with a fixed divider. The S8000 block becomes a compatible
 with the T8010 fallback, and the 32768 Hz rate moves to the DT.]
Co-developed-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Signed-off-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../bindings/clock/apple,t8010-touch-clock.yaml          | 9 +++++++--
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,t8010-touch-clock.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,t8010-touch-clock.yaml
index fc2f7e623..a87462eab 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,t8010-touch-clock.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/apple,t8010-touch-clock.yaml
@@ -11,11 +11,16 @@ maintainers:
 
 description:
   The T8010 PMGR contains a gate and integer divider for the 24 MHz clock
-  consumed by the touchscreen controller.
+  consumed by the touchscreen controller. The S8000 PMGR has the same block
+  at the same offset; the iPad 5 N1 touchscreen runs it at 32768 Hz.
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: apple,t8010-touch-clock
+    oneOf:
+      - const: apple,t8010-touch-clock
+      - items:
+          - const: apple,s8000-touch-clock
+          - const: apple,t8010-touch-clock
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
